      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A COLLINDA (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.99) at this track behind Star Fury in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Winning claims. WAX OFF (2) had some strong recent form but was below best last time when fifth (29.44) in a Grade 4/5 at Sale. Normally safely away but always well back and facing a task from wide out last time. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from four attempts. Leading chance. ANCHOR CRANKER (5) is better than last start when fifth (23.16) in a Grade 4/5 at this track over 400m. Worth another chance. BULA (6) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 1.1 lengths away in third (23.13).",
